## Setup Instructions

To set up the project locally, 
Installation

Clone the repository:git clone <https://github.co

Open index.htm
Navigate through the website using the browser.
All functionality is handled by vanilla JS scripts in ther.
Styles are located in the css/ folder.

Project Structure
